<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>每日看牙 - 沙雕园</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E7%9C%8B%E7%89%99/</link><description>欢迎来到沙雕园。本博客要素较多，包括但不限于数学、编程、游戏、吐槽、冲塔、科普、整活。</description><language>zh-cn</language><atom:link href="https://blog.shadiao.win/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E7%9C%8B%E7%89%99/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>#每日看牙 最近半年修复了两颗牙的bug，还有两颗牙惨遭根管儿治…</title><link>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112621752698360981/</link><guid>https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112621752698360981/</guid><description>&lt;blockquote>&lt;p>原帖内容提示：看牙/语无伦次/长篇大论&lt;/p>&lt;/blockquote>
&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://thu.closed.social/tags/%E6%AF%8F%E6%97%A5%E7%9C%8B%E7%89%99" rel="noopener noreferrer">#&lt;span>每日看牙&lt;/span>&lt;/a> 最近半年修复了两颗牙的bug，还有两颗牙惨遭根管儿治疗，并了解到口腔护理标准配置：每天（刷牙+牙线）+半年进行一次检查 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/630adb3280013865f421.png" alt=":tv50:" title=":tv50:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 深感国服口腔健康意识之落后（也可能只是我落后） &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/2ed4d525f5ad0fdaa44f.png" alt=":annoyingdog:" title=":annoyingdog:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> &lt;br>昨天又有一颗牙报错，只得又去窜访牙医，一番检查后得出结论：牙龈发言了 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/827bdcdc981cee1d99cf.png" alt=":0b04:" title=":0b04:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 而且牙周情况及其糟糕 😨 经过饼究，今天对患牙进行了龈下刮治，一个月后还要去清洗一下其它牙 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/4d5143941690f7df78d3.png" alt=":psyduck:" title=":psyduck:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 估计牙结石够抠一副麻将了&lt;br>不过xjp比较照顾患者体验 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/827bdcdc981cee1d99cf.png" alt=":0b04:" title=":0b04:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 过程中牙医会轮询疼不疼 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/190140f54f499ecd333c.png" alt=":aru_0010:" title=":aru_0010:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 如果疼他们会想方设法解决（比如打麻药/降低器械转速等），而不是让你忍着并以此为荣 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/aa653413e41c8f7de0de.png" alt=":wdg:" title=":wdg:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 或许这就是文化差异罢 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/686bbd7649cbb909fee9.png" alt=":dog_firefox:" title=":dog_firefox:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> &lt;br>不过确实贵 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/41d5db985b405659aece.png" alt=":ablobdundundun:" title=":ablobdundundun:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0"> 还好公丝保险能报销一部分，不然原地破产 &lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/closed-social-emoji/f73109c40bdab53a2cb3.png" alt=":blobsweats:" title=":blobsweats:" class="closed-social-emoji" width="24" height="24" style="display:inline-block;width:1.3em;height:1.3em;margin:0;vertical-align:-.2em;border-radius:0">&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;a href="https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112621752698360981/image-6a3cb74c26e4e202.jpg">&lt;img src="https://blog.shadiao.win/moments/closed-social-112621752698360981/image-6a3cb74c26e4e202.jpg" alt="配图 1" loading="lazy">&lt;/a>&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>